From f7947784609b7952f1b7b4fc95490c509a031c89 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 14:14:37 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): professional UI overhaul with a shared component
 kit

Design system (ui_kit.gd)
- Add spacing scale, SUCCESS/MUTED colours and a MutedLabel style
- Add reusable components: banner, button, stat_grid/add_stat, key_prompt,
  progress_bar, fade_in
- Add PrimaryButton (gold text) and ProgressBar theme styles
- Screens fade in; buttons move focus on hover so mouse, keyboard and
  gamepad never highlight two things at once

Screens
- Lobby: one card per player slot (WAITING / JOINING / NOT READY / READY)
  with short device names, and a countdown that says how to cancel
- Briefing: receipts are aligned tables with green bonuses, pink damage and
  a gold total; day status shown as chips
- Run over: headline numbers first, then breakdown; prompt dims during the
  input lockout
- Run panel / online menu: shared components, primary action, Esc hints,
  roster as a table, errors in pink
- Modifier picker: warning-coloured subtitle, hover focus, muted hint
- Job HUD: delivery progress bar, day clock turns gold then pink as it runs
  down, full controls reminder (lift, action, heave-ho)

Colour is never the only signal: every state also has text.
